1
00:00:13,323 --> 00:00:15,493
(Howard:)- Hi.
- Oh, hi, Penny.

2
00:00:15,659 --> 00:00:19,539
Yeah, FYI, the hot water is inadequate
on Machine 2, so colors only.

3
00:00:19,705 --> 00:00:22,745
Four is still releasing the fabric softener
too early in the cycle.

4
00:00:22,916 --> 00:00:26,256
(Sheldon:)- So I'd avoid using that for your delicates.
- Thanks.

5
00:00:29,047 --> 00:00:30,217
Well, good Lord.

6
00:00:30,382 --> 00:00:34,132
(Sheldon:)Why don't you just take your clothes down
to the river and beat them with a rock?

7
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:41,480
(Penny:)Sheldon, may I ask you a question?

8
00:00:41,977 --> 00:00:45,607
(Sheldon:)I would prefer that you not,
but I won't go so far as to forbid it.

9
00:00:46,606 --> 00:00:48,446
All right, I heard "yes," so...

10
00:00:49,609 --> 00:00:50,899
Okay, here's my question:

11
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:56,070
(Penny:)Has Leonard ever dated,
you know, a regular girl?

12
00:00:57,242 --> 00:01:01,022
(Sheldon:)Well, I assume you're not referring
to digestive regularity.

